# Rollback Procedure

## Purpose

Restore guest manager assignments if incorrect data was applied.

## Requirements

Backup file:

```text
SponsorManagerBackup.csv
```

created prior to updates.

## Review Backup

Inspect backup file to determine:

- Guest User
- Sponsor
- Original Manager State

## Rollback Method

For each affected guest:

1. Identify the intended manager.
2. Reassign using Microsoft Graph.
3. Validate result.

## Validation

Confirm restored values:

```powershell
az rest --method GET --url "https://graph.microsoft.com/v1.0/users/<GuestObjectID>/manager"
```

## Post-Rollback

Document:

- Date
- Administrator
- Number of accounts restored
- Reason for rollback
